# TOEFL Vocabulary Day59

| 단어 | 의미 | 예문 |
|---|---|---|
| eruption | 분출, 폭발 | The volcanic eruption lasted several hours. |
| magma | 마그마 | Magma rises beneath the Earth's surface. |
| lava | 용암 | Lava flowed down the mountain. |
| ash | 화산재 | Volcanic ash can travel long distances. |
| crater | 분화구 | The crater is located near the top of the volcano. |
| pressure | 압력 | Pressure can build beneath the Earth's surface. |
| release | 방출하다 | The eruption released large amounts of gas. |
| geological | 지질학적인 | Scientists study geological activity in the region. |

### 암기 포인트

- volcanic eruption: 화산 분출
- magma: 지하의 녹은 암석
- lava: 지표로 나온 마그마
- volcanic ash: 화산재
- crater: 분화구
- build pressure: 압력이 쌓이다
- release gas: 가스를 방출하다
- geological activity: 지질 활동
